OL,3,GNEWSAHospital criticised for failures
OL,4,Ain handling of foetuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has been heavily criticised
OL,7,Fover how its mortuary dealt with the
OL,8,Fremains of foetuses.
OL,10,FBoth major and critical failings were
OL,11,Ffound at the Countess of Chester
OL,12,Fhospital, including the babies' remains
OL,13,Fbeing left in fridges rather than
OL,14,Ffreezers, and the risk of bereaved
OL,15,Ffamilies being invited to view the
OL,16,Fwrong bodies.
OL,18,FThe inspection was carried out by the
OL,19,FHuman Tissue Authority (HTA), the
OL,20,Fwatchdog responsible for ensuring human
OL,21,Forgans and remains are properly
OL,22,Fhandled.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
