OL,3,GNEWSAHospital criticised for failures
OL,4,Ain handling of foetuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Countess of Chester Hospital NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust said it "fully
OL,8,Faccepted" the findings, apologised, and
OL,9,Fsaid procedures had since been
OL,10,F"strengthened".
